  "details": "There's currently no way to filter VRChat Feedback topics (bug reports) by \"Closed\" or \"Duplicate Post\" statuses directly from the list of filters. The only way to access these is by manipulating the URLs, for example:\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta?status=duplicate-post&sort=new\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta?status=closed&sort=new\n\nThis makes it more difficult to find already reported bugs.\n\nCan all or some of these be added to the list of filters, if it's even possible from the Canny administration options?",
